---
// src/components/Footer.astro
---

<!-- Tambahkan margin atas (mt-20) agar tidak menempel dengan konten di atasnya -->
<footer class="bg-emerald-800 text-white mt-20 pt-16">
  <!-- BAGIAN 1: CTA (Call to Action) "Mari Bersama Membangun Desa" -->
  <div class="text-center px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
      Mari Bersama Membangun Desa
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-emerald-100 mb-8 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto"
    >
      Bergabunglah dengan kami dalam memajukan Desa Muncangkopong. Suara dan
      partisipasi Anda sangat berarti bagi masa depan desa.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4">
      <!-- Tombol Kiri (Putih) -->
      <a
        href="/kontak"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-white text-emerald-900 hover:bg-emerald-50 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-bold transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md"
      >
        <span>📞</span> Hubungi Kami &rarr;
      </a>
      <!-- Tombol Kanan (Transparan bergaris) -->
      <a
        href="/kontak"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-emerald-700/50 border border-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-bold transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm"
      >
        <span>✉️</span> Layanan Desa
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BAGIAN 2: Informasi Footer (Grid 3 Kolom) -->
  <div
    class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pb-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 border-t border-emerald-700/50 pt-12"
  >
    <!-- Kolom 1: Identitas & Logo -->
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <!-- Lingkaran Inisial Logo (DM) -->
        <img
          src="/image/logo_lebak.png"
          alt="Logo Kabupaten Lebak"
          class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-18 sm:h-18 object-contain shrink-0 drop-shadow-md"
        />
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg leading-tight">Desa Muncangkopong</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-emerald-300 mt-0.5">
            Kec. Cikulur, Kab. Lebak
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-emerald-100/90 leading-relaxed pr-4">
        Website resmi Pemerintahan Desa Muncangkopong. Pusat informasi publik,
        transparansi kegiatan, dan layanan masyarakat desa secara digital.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Kolom 2: Kontak -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-5 text-emerald-50 tracking-wider text-sm">
        KONTAK
      </h4>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-emerald-100/90">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5">📍</span>
          <span class="leading-relaxed"
            >Kp. Desa Muncangkopong RT/RW 003/001 Ds. Muncangkopong Kec. Cikulur
            Kab. Lebak, Banten</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span>✉️</span>
          <span>dmuncangkopong@gmail.com</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span>📞</span>
          <span>-</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Kolom 3: Link Terkait -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-5 text-emerald-50 tracking-wider text-sm">
        LINK TERKAIT
      </h4>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-emerald-100/90 flex flex-col">
        <li>
          <a
            href="/"
            class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
            ><span class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">▶</span> Beranda</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="/profil"
            class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
            ><span class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">▶</span> Profil Desa</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="/potensi"
            class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
            ><span class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">▶</span> Galeri & Potensi</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="/berita"
            class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
            ><span class="text-emerald-500 text-xs">▶</span> Berita Terkini</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BAGIAN 3: Copyright -->
  <div
    class="bg-emerald-950 py-5 text-center text-xs text-emerald-400/80 border-t border-emerald-900"
  >
    &copy; 2026 Pemerintah Desa Muncangkopong. Developed by <span
      class="font-bold text-emerald-300">KKM 82 BINA BANGSA 2026</span
    >.
  </div>
</footer>
